# CITATION.cff for ASSURED CRISPR Designer
# Draft prepared for owner review. Items marked TODO(owner) need a decision or data only the owner has.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file. A versioned archive DOI will be added after the first archived release."
type: software
title: "ASSURED CRISPR Designer"
abstract: >-
  Browser and command-line design tool for CRISPR-Cas9 knockouts, point mutations and
  tag or reporter knock-ins in human pluripotent stem cells. It designs two guides per
  edit, grades re-cutting protection of the repaired allele by CFD, builds ssODN, block or
  AAV donors, proposes genotyping primers, reports a per-pair release state, and writes a
  design hand-off file (assured-qc-design/1) for the Assured QC app.
authors:
  - family-names: Telugu
    given-names: Narasimha
    affiliation: "Max Delbrück Center for Molecular Medicine in the Helmholtz Association (MDC), Berlin, Germany"
    # TODO(owner): add orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000" and any co-authors before release.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Narasimhat/Assured_CRISPR_Design"
url: "https://assured-crispr-design.vercel.app"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - CRISPR
  - Cas9
  - guide RNA design
  - homology-directed repair
  - ssODN
  - human induced pluripotent stem cells
